---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Accessibility Statement"
  description="Deep Bio Data's commitment to digital accessibility, in line with WCAG 2.2 level AA and the European standard EN 301 549."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal-content">
      <p class="overline">Legal</p>
      <h1>Accessibility statement</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last reviewed: November 2026</p>
      <p class="lede">
        Deep Bio Data is committed to making this website accessible to everyone,
        regardless of ability or the technology they use.
      </p>

      <h2>Conformance</h2>
      <p>
        This website is designed to conform to the <strong>Web Content Accessibility
        Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2, level AA</strong>, the reference criteria of the European
        digital accessibility standard EN 301 549.
      </p>
      <p>
        Status: <strong>conformant</strong> following the internal review of November
        2026, which included source-code, colour-contrast and keyboard-navigation
        checks. This statement will be reviewed again after any significant change to
        the website.
      </p>

      <h2>Measures applied</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Semantic HTML with a coherent heading hierarchy</li>
        <li>Colour contrast verified for every text/background pair</li>
        <li>Full keyboard navigation with a visible focus indicator</li>
        <li>Skip link to the main content</li>
        <li>Touch targets of at least 44 pixels on main mobile controls</li>
        <li>Respect for the system "reduce motion" preference</li>
        <li>Labelled forms, with error messages announced by screen readers</li>
        <li>Descriptive alternative text on images and graphics</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Feedback</h2>
      <p>
        If you encounter any access barrier or need the information in an alternative
        format, please contact us at
        <a href="mailto:info@deepbiodata.com">info@deepbiodata.com</a> or on
        <a href="tel:+351965636559">+351 965 636 559</a>. We will reply within 5 business
        days and, where needed, will provide the content through an accessible channel.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
